# The page is generated, not hand-edited: scripts/build-privacy-page.mjs in the
# verso repo renders docs/privacy-policy.md into index.html and writes it here.
# That generator emits LF. Without this file, git stores CRLF on Windows, so
# every regeneration shows up as a whole-file diff and the one line that
# actually changed is invisible in review — on a legal document whose entire
# failure mode is a change nobody noticed.
* text=auto eol=lf
